{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/a6afc6f62dec055f62715b103a259a25.avif?t=1758462302\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Detective Who Faints at the Sight of Blood, and a Mysterious Murder Case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Detective Bloodphobia</i> is a visual novel set in the late 20th century, following a protagonist who collapses at the sight of blood while pursuing a murder case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With noir-inspired black-and-white graphics and a classic mystery narrative, the game delivers deep immersion in solving crimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/94a5e161e727676b8864380698ecb8d4.avif?t=1758462302\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Investigation Part ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on objects in the background to uncover evidence.<br>Even the smallest clue may become the key that leads to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/1741e8068366b821d75e6813097f0866.avif?t=1758462302\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Deduction Part ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link together the collected evidence to challenge testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When contradictions are exposed, fragments of the truth are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, players must dig into lies and connect clues to raise new suspicions.<br>The detective, together with his assistant, unravels the case and approaches the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he be able to solve the case to the very end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856260?t=1758462302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856260?t=1758462302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/a164ea47c11b7a2afd88eab13a359a707b4ac7b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758462302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/a164ea47c11b7a2afd88eab13a359a707b4ac7b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758462302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/a6afc6f62dec055f62715b103a259a25.avif?t=1758462302\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Detective Who Faints at the Sight of Blood, and a Mysterious Murder Case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Detective Bloodphobia</i> is a visual novel set in the late 20th century, following a protagonist who collapses at the sight of blood while pursuing a murder case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With noir-inspired black-and-white graphics and a classic mystery narrative, the game delivers deep immersion in solving crimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/94a5e161e727676b8864380698ecb8d4.avif?t=1758462302\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Investigation Part ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on objects in the background to uncover evidence.<br>Even the smallest clue may become the key that leads to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/extras/1741e8068366b821d75e6813097f0866.avif?t=1758462302\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Deduction Part ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link together the collected evidence to challenge testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When contradictions are exposed, fragments of the truth are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, players must dig into lies and connect clues to raise new suspicions.<br>The detective, together with his assistant, unravels the case and approaches the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will he be able to solve the case to the very end?</p>","developers":["Gustav","LuB2an"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3856210","name":"Detective Bloodphobia"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856260/4363d65890c55ff482173dee7b29a174af5cf45d/header.jpg?t=1758462302","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Detective Bloodphobia  <br />\r\n\u00a9 2024 Gustav & LuB2an. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191579,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s